<title>USA: MBIA has capacity for San Bernardino Cty, Calif.</title>
<headline>MBIA has capacity for San Bernardino Cty, Calif.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said Thursday it approved for secondary market insurance a limited amount of San Bernardino County, Calif., certificates of participation series 1994, Medical Center project.</p>
<p>Capacity is initially limited to $10 million per firm and is available on a first-come, first-served basis. For more information, call 800-624-2669.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
